  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping and process assistance for an evaluation of Denmark&apos;s action plan for implementation of UNSCR 1325 Women, Peace and Security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EVAL intends to employ scoping and process assistance in connection with the preparation and carrying out of an evaluation of Denmark&apos;s action plan for the implementation of the UN Security Council Resolution 1325 on women, peace and security. The consultants will be involved in the design of the evaluation as well as in quality assurance in the course of work, notably in connection with draft reports. Analysis of reports and studies dealing with national actions plans for the UNSCR 1325 as well as scoping evaluation questions and determining the appropriate methods for the evaluation will be the main activities to be undertaken.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final evaluation report available at: https://um.dk/en/danida-en/results/eval/eval_reports/publicationdisplaypage/?publicationID=1456CEB1-9B73-447F-A2AB-4E6514CF1517</narrative>
  </description>
